# Bringing AI to the Classroom

#### Whe we talk about bringing AI to the students in your school and classroom we can talk about teaching with AI or teaching about AI. 


<div style="text-align:center;">
  <img 
    src="https://images.code.org/b83679a5c60b1c90831a4b35461b5103-Screenshot 2026-03-11 at 1.06.25 PM.png" 
    alt="Potential benefits and risks of AI in education."
    style="width:75%; max-width:100%; height:auto;"
  >
</div>

*Image: TeachAI*


#### Take a look at the chart below to explore some examples of these two concepts and to preview what you'll be learning about in this module.

<body style="margin:0; padding:20px; background-color:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<div style="max-width:980px; margin:0 auto;">
<div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:nowrap; gap:16px;">

<div style="flex:1; min-width:0; background-color:#F7F8FA; border-radius:6px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden;">
<div style="background-color:#8C52BA; color:#ffffff; padding:10px 14px; font-weight:600; font-size:20px;">Teaching <span style="opacity:0.95;">with</span> AI</div>
<div style="padding:14px 16px 16px 16px;">

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">👩‍🏫</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Supporting teaching practice</strong> by generating lesson ideas, materials, feedback, and differentiation strategies
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">💬</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Supporting student learning</strong> through explanations, examples, tutoring, and guided practice
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧩</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Assisting with academic work</strong> like brainstorming, drafting, problem-solving, and studying
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🔁</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Providing feedback and revision support</strong> to improve clarity, accuracy, and quality of work
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">📊</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Supporting assessment and monitoring</strong> through practice questions, checks for understanding, and progress insights
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🏫</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Assisting with school operations</strong> such as communication, planning, and administrative tasks
</div></div>

</div>
</div>


<div style="flex:1; min-width:0; background-color:#F7F8FA; border-radius:6px; box-sizing:border-box; overflow:hidden;">
<div style="background-color:#8C52BA; color:#ffffff; padding:10px 14px; font-weight:600; font-size:20px;">Teaching <span style="opacity:0.95;">about</span> AI</div>
<div style="padding:14px 16px 16px 16px;">

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧠</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Understanding how AI works</strong> including data, models, training processes, and prediction
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🔍</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Examining AI outputs</strong> to understand accuracy, bias, limitations, and uncertainty
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🔬</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Exploring how AI systems are built</strong> through models, datasets, and simple simulations
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🧑‍⚖️</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Analyzing societal and ethical impacts</strong> such as bias, privacy, fairness, and misinformation
</div></div>

<div style="display:flex; align-items:flex-start;">
<div style="width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#e0f4f7; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:16px; margin-right:10px;">🌍</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; color:#333333;">
<strong>Connecting AI to disciplines</strong> like computer science, data science, mathematics, science, and social studies
</div></div>

</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</body>

#### We covered some aspects of teaching with AI, including supporting teaching practice aspects and asssisting with school operations, in Module 3, Transforming Teaching with AI.

#### In this moduel, we'll continue to learn more about teaching with AI as well as all aspects of teaching about AI.
